    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41631" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρο-τονία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>voting by show of hands,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				755e
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τονίαν διδόναι, εἰ δοκεῖ..ἢ μή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					43.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confirmation</i> of the powers of magistrates, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				58.27
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				55.4
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αὐτῶν ἐστί..εἰ δοκοῦσιν
				καλῶς ἄρχειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				61.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. νόμων</span>
			<i>confirmation</i> of the existing laws, Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.20
			</span></i>.</div>
